{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mycelium Mayhem is a singleplayer combat game where you plays as a tiny Mushroom fighting Isopods on a stump! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBAT Player and enemies are tied to a looped ability system that perform actions automatically in a cycle. Move around an aim your skills to defeat enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/699423776fbd877591463babb6541465.poster.avif?t=1756929490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/699423776fbd877591463babb6541465.webm?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/699423776fbd877591463babb6541465.mp4?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR LOOP In the beggining of the game and between rounds you can buy, sell and repositon abilities in your loop. Be strategic with your placement to counter enemies and build stronger combos! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/f010cfda8537318bf7b02cf1f8b4bed4.poster.avif?t=1756929490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/f010cfda8537318bf7b02cf1f8b4bed4.webm?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/f010cfda8537318bf7b02cf1f8b4bed4.mp4?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win rounds by defeating all enemies, but beware! Each round increases in difficulty! Try to survive as long as you can!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/485fedd1fa54a5390a8508b151d23ac6.poster.avif?t=1756929490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/485fedd1fa54a5390a8508b151d23ac6.webm?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/485fedd1fa54a5390a8508b151d23ac6.mp4?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964740?t=1756929490","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/b98cb52089c1e495c223cccf02d23a00a1171515/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756929490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/fd0e5d1121386437e4334350c97b2ce5924f1a1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756929490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/fd0e5d1121386437e4334350c97b2ce5924f1a1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756929490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mycelium Mayhem is a singleplayer combat game where you plays as a tiny Mushroom fighting Isopods on a stump! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBAT Player and enemies are tied to a looped ability system that perform actions automatically in a cycle. Move around an aim your skills to defeat enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/699423776fbd877591463babb6541465.poster.avif?t=1756929490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/699423776fbd877591463babb6541465.webm?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/699423776fbd877591463babb6541465.mp4?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR LOOP In the beggining of the game and between rounds you can buy, sell and repositon abilities in your loop. Be strategic with your placement to counter enemies and build stronger combos! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/f010cfda8537318bf7b02cf1f8b4bed4.poster.avif?t=1756929490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/f010cfda8537318bf7b02cf1f8b4bed4.webm?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740/extras/f010cfda8537318bf7b02cf1f8b4bed4.mp4?t=1756929490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win rounds by defeating all enemies, but beware! Each round increases in difficulty! Try to survive as long as you can!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964740